# No prod deploy / no commit without explicit ask

- Do **not** run production deploys (Cloud Run, Vercel, or any live environment) unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
- Do **not** create git commits, amend commits, or open PRs unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
- Local runs, tests, and code changes are fine when implementing a requested feature.
- If unsure whether deploy/commit was requested, ask first — do not proceed.
